{
  "name": "@dsh-external/dsh-teamkit",
  "version": "0.1.3",
  "description": "Agent Teams 的组织层插件：上游/ fork / PR 三件套（每个成员一份只存差异的技能工作副本 + 上游变更通知 + 带强制说明的上游合并/回退），零运行时依赖、零硬编码路径、可卸净。",
  "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
  "//repository": "⚠️ **发布前必须填真实地址**（2026-09-14 / Round 95 开源就绪审计确认：这三个字段确实缺）。**不编 URL**：本仓没有 git remote（`git remote -v` = `fatal: not a git repository`），仓里也**没有任何\"本包要发到哪个仓库\"的事实**。⇒ 按 `H20` 的既有约定：**缺字段 + 写明理由**（而不是填个 `TODO` 假装有）。发布人**必须**在发之前把 `repository` / `homepage` / `bugs` 三件填上，然后删掉本字段。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "agent-teams",
    "multi-agent",
    "omc",
    "one-man-company",
    "organization",
    "skills",
    "fork",
    "orchestration"
  ],
  "//repository": "本地开发仓没有 git remote（`git remote -v` ⇒ \"not a git repository\"）⇒ **不编 URL**。发布到公开仓时补 `repository` / `homepage` / `bugs` 三个字段。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./config": "./lib/config.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "bin": {
    "teamkit": "./bin/teamkit.mjs",
    "teamkit-install": "./tools/install-teamkit.mjs"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "bin",
    "scripts",
    "patches",
    "skills",
    "assets",
    "tools",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill": ">=0.0.1-rc <2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent": ">=0.0.1-rc <2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.0.1-rc <2",
    "cordis": ">=4.0.0-rc <5"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "cordis": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "//check-all": "一条命令跑完全部校验器（7 个）。⚠️ 它在**仓根** `tools/` 下（不在包内）⇒ 只有仓内开发时可用。",
    "check-all": "node ../tools/check-all.mjs",
    "selftest": "node ./bin/teamkit.mjs selftest",
    "sync-skills": "node ./scripts/sync-skills.mjs",
    "sync-skills:check": "node ./scripts/sync-skills.mjs --check",
    "sync-assets": "node ./scripts/sync-assets.mjs",
    "sync-assets:check": "node ./scripts/sync-assets.mjs --check",
    "install-teamkit": "node ./tools/install-teamkit.mjs",
    "e2e-tarball": "node ./scripts/e2e-tarball.mjs"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  }
}